      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors regularly compliment the clinic interior for its clean, orderly layout and welcoming atmosphere. Owners note that the calm examination rooms and thoughtfully organized layout help reduce anxiety for visiting pets during wellness checkups and routine care."
      }
